{"page":383,"verses":[{"verse_key":"27:64","surah":27,"ayah":64,"ar_uthmani":"أَمَّن يَبْدَؤُا۟ ٱلْخَلْقَ ثُمَّ يُعِيدُهُۥ وَمَن يَرْزُقُكُم مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ أَءِلَـٰهٌ مَّعَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ قُلْ هَاتُوا۟ بُرْهَـٰنَكُمْ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who is it that creates life and reproduces it? Who is it that gives you provision from the heavens and earth? Is it another god beside God?’ Say, ‘Show me your evidence then, if what you say is true.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمَّن","en_gloss":"Or Who","transliteration":"amman","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","en_gloss":"originates","transliteration":"yabda-u","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْخَلْقَ","en_gloss":"the creation","transliteration":"l-khalqa","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُعِيدُهُۥ","en_gloss":"repeats it","transliteration":"yuʿīduhu","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and Who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَرْزُقُكُم","en_gloss":"provides you","transliteration":"yarzuqukum","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَءِلَـٰهٌۭ","en_gloss":"Is there any god","transliteration":"a-ilāhun","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":15,"ar":"هَاتُوا۟","en_gloss":"Bring forth","transliteration":"hātū","verse_key":"27:64"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بُرْهَـٰنَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your proof","trans